*** Keywords ***
CB010846_RU_resilency_controlled_case_capacity_unit_reset
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of this test case is to check if feature can be activated online and if RMOD did not reset during
    ...  “cntrldResetMplaneBreakTime” duration after BBMOD reset via admin CLI and connectivity during this procedure to
    ...  other external network elements will not be affected.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param (int or str) rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD configuration id of tested radio module, e.g.: 1


    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    config_operations.connect                               alias=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${initial_actRuResetResiliency_value}                   Get actRuResetResiliency parameter value

    Set actRuResetResiliency parameter                      target_value=true

    ${rmod_startup_before_bbmod_reset}                      Get DateTime of Last RMOD Startup
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${bbmod_config}                                         admin_info_model.get_bbmod_ids_for_all_rmods_links
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${impacted_bbmod_id}                                    Set variable
    ...                                                     ${bbmod_config[${rmod_id}]["synchronization"][0]}
    ${list_with_impacted_bbmod_id}                          Create list
    ...                                                     ${impacted_bbmod_id}

    ${impacted_rmod_ids}                                    Get impacted RMODs For Impacted BBMOD
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmod_id=${impacted_bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Reset BBMOD And Check Statuses                          bbmod_id=${impacted_bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Sleep                                                   20s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting for status update of all components...

    Verify All BBMODs Statuses and Their Resources with Impacted BBMODs and RMODs
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmod_ids=${list_with_impacted_bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmods_status_variant=initializing
    ...                                                     impacted_rmods_ids=${impacted_rmod_ids}
    ...                                                     impacted_rmods_status_variant=disabled
    ...                                                     alternative_impacted_rmods_status_variant=offline
    ...                                                     impacted_cells_status_variant=failed
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Check Statuses after Capacity Unit Reset and Wait for OnAir
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_startup_after_bbmod_reset}                       Get DateTime of Last RMOD Startup
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying if RMOD-${rmod_id} has been reset during capacity unit reset...
    Verify If RMOD Has Been Reset                           reference_startup_datetime=${rmod_startup_before_bbmod_reset}
    ...                                                     actual_startup_datetime=${rmod_startup_after_bbmod_reset}
    ...                                                     expect_rmod_reset=${False}
    Robot Log Result                                        RMOD-${rmod_id} has not been reset during capacity unit reset.

    Set actRuResetResiliency parameter                      target_value=false

    ${bbmod_config}                                         admin_info_model.get_bbmod_ids_for_all_rmods_links
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${impacted_bbmod_id}                                    Set variable
    ...                                                     ${bbmod_config[${rmod_id}]["synchronization"][0]}
    ${list_with_impacted_bbmod_id}                          Create list
    ...                                                     ${impacted_bbmod_id}

    ${impacted_rmod_ids}                                    Get impacted RMODs For Impacted BBMOD
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmod_id=${impacted_bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Reset BBMOD And Check Statuses                          bbmod_id=${impacted_bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Sleep                                                   20s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting for status update of all components...

    Verify All BBMODs Statuses and Their Resources with Impacted BBMODs and RMODs
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmod_ids=${list_with_impacted_bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     impacted_bbmods_status_variant=initializing
    ...                                                     impacted_rmods_ids=${impacted_rmod_ids}
    ...                                                     impacted_rmods_status_variant=disabled
    ...                                                     alternative_impacted_rmods_status_variant=offline
    ...                                                     impacted_cells_status_variant=failed
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Check Statuses after Capacity Unit Reset and Wait for OnAir
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_startup_after_bbmod_reset}                       Get DateTime of Last RMOD Startup
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying if RMOD-${rmod_id} has been reset during capacity unit reset...
    Verify If RMOD Has Been Reset                           reference_startup_datetime=${rmod_startup_before_bbmod_reset}
    ...                                                     actual_startup_datetime=${rmod_startup_after_bbmod_reset}
    ...                                                     expect_rmod_reset=${True}
    Robot Log Result                                        RMOD-${rmod_id} has been reset during capacity unit reset.

    [Teardown]                                              RU Resilency Capacity Unit Reset Teardown
    ...                                                     initial_actRuResetResiliency_value=${initial_actRuResetResiliency_value}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

Set actRuResetResiliency parameter
    [Arguments]    ${target_value}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Setting 'actRuResetResiliency' parameter on `${target_value}`

    config_operations.set_parameter_value                   dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                                     param_name=actRuResetResiliency
    ...                                                     param_value=${target_value}

    Robot Log Result                                        Parameter 'actRuResetResiliency' has been set on `${target_value}`

Get actRuResetResiliency parameter value

    Robot Log Operation                                     Getting 'actRuResetResiliency' parameter value

    ${param_value}                                          config_operations.get_parameter_value
    ...                                                     dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                                     param_name=actRuResetResiliency

    Robot Log Result                                        Current parameter 'actRuResetResiliency' value is `${param_value}`

    [Return]    ${param_value}

Reset BBMOD And Check Statuses
    [Arguments]    ${bbmod_id}
    ...            ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing BBMOD-${bbmod_id} reset...
    Alarms.Allow X2 Link Alarms
    Alarms.Allow alarm                                      fault_id=16
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7116
    ...                                                     severity=Critical
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Create admin session with custom alias                  connection=bbmod_reset
    ...                                                     timeout=120s
    ...                                                     logs_path=/tmp/api_logs/bbmod_reset
    admin_info_model.reset_bbmod_in_separate_process        connection=bbmod_reset
    ...                                                     bbmod_id=${bbmod_id}

    Wait for BBMOD to reach specific statuses               bbmod_id=${bbmod_id}
    ...                                                     status_variant=disabled
    ...                                                     timeout=2min
    ...                                                     step=3s

    Robot Log Operation                                     BBMOD-${bbmod_id} goes reset.

    [Return]    ${bbmod_id}

Check Statuses after Capacity Unit Reset and Wait for OnAir
    [Arguments]    ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting for BBMOD startup after reset...

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 5min
    ...                                                     30sec
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                   fault_id=16
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7116
    ...                                                     severity=Critical
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying BTS OnAir state...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 5min
    ...                                                     10s
    ...                                                     Verify BTS states
    ...                                                     status=OnAir
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Alarms.Disallow X2 Link Alarms

    Robot Log Result                                        BBMOD reset procedure has finished succesfully. BTS is fully operational.

RU Resilency Capacity Unit Reset Teardown
    [Arguments]    ${initial_actRuResetResiliency_value}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Performing RU Resilency Capacity Unit Reset Teardown...

    ${current_actRuResetResiliency_value}                   Get actRuResetResiliency parameter value

    Run keyword if                                          """${initial_actRuResetResiliency_value}""" != """${current_actRuResetResiliency_value}"""
    ...                                                     Run keywords
    ...                                                     Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                     Reverting parameter 'actRuResetResiliency' to initial value...
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Set actRuResetResiliency parameter
    ...                                                     target_value=${initial_actRuResetResiliency_value}

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 5min
    ...                                                     30sec
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying BTS OnAir state...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 5min
    ...                                                     10s
    ...                                                     Verify BTS states
    ...                                                     status=OnAir
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Result                                        Teardown performed succesfully.
